And we can look at the National debt. Under Obama, the national debt was increased by 9.32 trillion dollars (an increase of 76%). Biden has the largest national debt dollar increase in US history for a single term (8.45 trillion, which increased the already ridiculously high national debt by another 30.5%) Trump also increase the national debt significantly by 7.8 trillion, though that is still lower than the last two democrat administrations.  
GDP growth under Biden and Trump is pretty average (Trump 3.11% v. Biden's 3.01%). Obama's GDP growth was just 0.54% with a per capita of -0.30%, which is the worst GDP growth since WW2.
